OL,3,GNEWSAFoxes announce new sponsor after  
OL,4,Aporn actress row                       
OL,6,FLeicester City have announced a new    
OL,7,Fmain shirt sponsor after ending a      
OL,8,Fpartnership with a gambling firm       
OL,9,Ffollowing its appointment of a porn    
OL,10,Factress as its brand ambassador.       
OL,12,FThe League One side confirmed they have
OL,13,Fnow partnered with Bossjob, an         
OL,14,FAI-powered recruitment and job-matching
OL,15,Fplatform based in Singapore.           
OL,17,FOn Wednesday, the club announced its   
OL,18,Fsplit with BC Game - which was named as
OL,19,Fa sponsor for the Foxes at the start of
OL,20,Fthe 2024-25 season.                    
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
