OL,3,GNEWSAFoxes announce new sponsor after  
OL,4,Aporn actress row                       
OL,6,FThe club's commercial director, Russell
OL,7,FJones, said the new men's team sponsor 
OL,8,Fwould be in place for the remainder of 
OL,9,Fthe 2026-27 season.                    
